# Flits-verwijderaar V2 — build spec

Guided, region-first flash restorer. No AI. No stripe retouch. No full-image auto-clean.

## Flow (two pages)
Page 1 "Waar zitten de flitsen?":
- Upload JPEG/PNG; zoom/pan; original bitmap kept in memory.
- Coarse pink ROI brush (multi-region, freehand). Dilate ROI a few px for detection only.
- Intensity slider: "Alleen de felste" (default) <-> "Ook zwakkere witte stippen".
- "Detecteer in selectie" -> yellow preview ONLY inside dilated ROI. Rerun after editing.
- "Invullen" -> local fill of accepted yellow pixels only.
Page 2 "Nakijken":
- Filled result, before/after toggle.
- "Extra puntje weg": click or mini-brush -> detector in a small window/mini-ROI, fill if found.
- "Herstellen": brush copies original pixels back + 1px seam blend.
- Undo stack. Export original format (PNG->PNG, JPEG->JPEG q=1.0).

## Detection (inside ROI only, dual-path OR, then filters)
Pixel-level, gray L = 0.2126R+0.7152G+0.0722B:
- Path A (white on dark/medium, robust): robust local background B (strided sliding median, window ~2M+1, M ~ longEdge/120, stride ~M; local MAD from same histogram). Candidate where L - B > tPeak AND L > minBright AND tPeak_eff >= max(tPeak, 1.5*MAD).
- Path B (top-hat, mid/light paint): opened = erode(dilate(L,k)) box, k ~ max(3, longEdge/400); topHat = L - opened; candidate where topHat > tTop.
- Whiteness: sat = max(RGB)-min(RGB); component must be >=75% pixels with sat < tSat, and meanL >= minBright.
Component-level filters (connected components of candidate set):
- Size: minArea..maxArea; max diameter Dmax = longEdge/lerp(48,34,intensity); min diameter ~ max(2, longEdge/3000).
- Compact: bbox aspect <= 1.7 AND extent = area/bboxArea >= 0.45 (rejects scratches/canvas ribs/fibers).
- Isolation/ring test: ring mean (bbox dilated by ringW ~ max(3, longEdge/500) minus bbox) < blob mean - tIsol (rejects broad bright plateaus: ring also bright).
- Peak: blob mean > local background mean + tPeak.
Accept -> halo: dilate accepted px by haloR ~ clamp(round(r*0.5)+2, 2, 8), clipped to dilated ROI (never leaves pink).

Intensity slider mapping (i=0 felste .. 1 meer):
- tPeak lerp(28,14), minBright lerp(205,160